<div n="3" type="jArticle" xml:id="a1a" next="#a1b"><dateline>* <hi rendition="#b">Berlin.</hi> 12. Dec.</dateline> <p>Der <hi rendition="#g">Bundesrath</hi> ertheilte in der<lb/>
